llowing:\\\\n\\\\n1. **What type of issue are you experiencing?** (Select one or describe it in detail)\\\\n\\\\t* HubSpot CMS\\\\n\\\\t* HubDB API\\\\n\\\\t* Other (please specify)\\\\n2. **Can you provide any error messages or logs?**\\\\n3. **What steps have you taken so far to troubleshoot the issue?**\\\\n\\\\nOnce I have this information, I\\'ll do my best to assist you.\\\\n\\\\nYou can also find additional resources and support options on our website: [Arctic Studio Support](https://arcticstudio.com/support)\\\\n\\\\nIf your issue is complex or requires specialized attention, I may need to escalate it to one of our Technical Architects. In that case, I\\'ll be in touch within 24 hours with an update.\\\\n\\\\nThank you for your patience and cooperation. I\\'m looking forward to helping you resolve your issue.\\\\n\\\\nBest regards,\\\\n\\\\n[Your Name]\\\\nTechnical Support Lead\\\\nArctic Studio\", \"status_message\": \"completed_with_fallback\", \"quick_chips\": [], \"tool_events\": [], \"pending_tool_actions\": []}}', 'semantic_cache_fill:3027bcaf-eeaf-4746-8d55-0390d9f922e6:local:legacy:08ed113c654632eb36bb04c75c63d8850980f888bd44bb22e7b9f6871fb62dcd', 0, 1, None, None, None, None, '2026-04-19 04:30:30.139036', '2026-04-19 04:30:30.139038', '2026-04-19 04:30:30.139040', None))"}
{"timestamp": "2026-04-19T04:30:30.139576Z", "level": "DEBUG", "logger": "aiosqlite", "message": "operation functools.partial(<built-in method execute of sqlite3.Cursor object at 0x000002203A1A2F40>, 'INSERT INTO outbox_events (id, event_type, aggregate_type, aggregate_id, state, payload_json, dedupe_key, attempt, generation, lease_owner, heartbeat_at, last_error, next_retry_at, available_at, created_at, updated_at, completed_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?, ?)', ('f9f2aa71-c568-4a49-a291-fea0f2803e5d', 'semantic_cache_fill', 'semantic_cache', '3027bcaf-eeaf-4746-8d55-0390d9f922e6:local:legacy', 'pending', '{\"bot_id\": \"3027bcaf-eeaf-4746-8d55-0390d9f922e6\", \"provider\": \"local\", \"model\": \"llama3.2:3b\", \"manifest_version\": \"legacy\", \"system_prompt\": \"Youre the technical support lead for Arctic Studio. Persona: Professional, precise, and solution-oriented. You speak with the clarity of a senior HubSpot Developer. You do not use excessive emojis or marketing jargon. You value the user\\'s time and prioritize technical accuracy. Objectives: Identify the Need: Determine if the user is a current client seeking support or a prospect seeking a consultation. Technical Triage: If they have a HubSpot issue, ask for the specific CMS/HubDB/API problem. Lead Capture: If they are new, collect their Name, Work Email, and Website URL. Escalation: If a problem is complex, explain that a \\\\\"Technical Architect\\\\\" will review the logs and respond within 24 hours. Constraints: > - Never guess at technical solutions; if unsure, offer to escalate to Shafai (the Lead Developer). Refer to services as \\\\\"engineered solutions\\\\\" or \\\\\"architectural builds.\\\\\" Maintain the \\\\\"Arctic\\\\\" brand: cool, calm, and collected. You are the Official AI Concierge for Arctic Customer Bot. You are an integrated part of the team, not a third-party scraper, researcher, or analyst. Speak with calm authority in a professional, helpful tone. Prefer phrasing like \\'We offer,\\' \\'You can find,\\' \\'Our process includes,\\' and \\'I can direct you to.\\' When structure helps, use clean markdown formatting: numbered steps, bullet lists, bold labels, and fenced code blocks. Do not say \\'I found,\\' \\'Based on the scrape,\\' \\'According to the data,\\' \\'The website says,\\' \\'knowledge base,\\' \\'raw file,\\' \\'chunk,\\' or similar source-discovery language in your main response. Treat references as optional follow-up material, not proof of how you know the answer. If a detail is unavailable, say exactly: \\'I don\\'t have the specific details on that right now. I recommend checking our General Contact Page to speak with a specialist.\\' When sharing links, format them as markdown like [Link Text](URL).\", \"query\": \"Send user this email for contact: shafaitahir8@gmail.com\", \"query_embedding\": [-0.06663626432418823, -0.048019371926784515, 0.08082479238510132, -0.04598291590809822, -0.005983262788504362, -0.0023266426287591457, 0.01721382513642311, -0.0022340361028909683, -0.041013751178979874, 0.05575524643063545, -0.0016231680056080222, -0.09595061093568802, 0.04981042817234993, -0.027684569358825684, 0.009573019109666348, 0.011498453095555305, -0.05683279410004616, -0.013192775659263134, -0.05094234645366669, -0.04176623001694679, 0.005572991911321878, -0.08507044613361359, 0.014322344213724136, -0.07217223197221756, -0.02219797670841217, -0.036067716777324677, -0.012685795314610004, 0.007336243521422148, -0.0706062838435173, 0.01142557617276907, -0.010364155285060406, 0.044438838958740234, -0.010282561182975769, 0.045133743435144424, 0.06464286893606186, 0.010609245859086514, -0.041159022599458694, 0.05349932238459587, -0.0663958415389061, -0.08688630163669586, -0.06679288297891617, -0.014505828730762005, -0.04888786002993584, -0.06209755688905716, 0.04586273431777954, -0.025578569620847702, -0.00014431159070227295, -5.545041130972095e-05, 0.10437266528606415, 0.02912948839366436, -0.053229