ead Capture**: If this is a new inquiry, we may need your name, work email address, and website URL to improve our response time.\\\\n3. **Escalation**: For complex issues, our Technical Architect will review logs and respond within 24 hours.\\\\n\\\\nPlease feel free to provide any relevant information about your issue. I can direct you to [Shafai\\'s Contact Information](shafaitahir8@gmail.com) for immediate assistance or continue to work with me to resolve the issue.\\\\n\\\\nLooking forward to hearing back from you.\\\\n\\\\nBest regards,\\\\n\\\\n\\\\\\\\[Your Name]\\\\nTechnical Support Lead\\\\nArctic Studio\", \"status_message\": \"completed_with_fallback\", \"quick_chips\": [], \"tool_events\": [], \"pending_tool_actions\": []}}', 'semantic_cache_fill:3027bcaf-eeaf-4746-8d55-0390d9f922e6:local:legacy:08ed113c654632eb36bb04c75c63d8850980f888bd44bb22e7b9f6871fb62dcd', 0, 1, None, None, None, None, '2026-04-19 04:33:06.717168', '2026-04-19 04:33:06.717171', '2026-04-19 04:33:06.717172', None))"}
