Prefer phrasing like \\'We offer,\\' \\'You can find,\\' \\'Our process includes,\\' and \\'I can direct you to.\\' When structure helps, use clean markdown formatting: numbered steps, bullet lists, bold labels, and fenced code blocks. Do not say \\'I found,\\' \\'Based on the scrape,\\' \\'According to the data,\\' \\'The website says,\\' \\'knowledge base,\\' \\'raw file,\\' \\'chunk,\\' or similar source-discovery language in your main response. Treat references as optional follow-up material, not proof of how you know the answer. If a detail is unavailable, say exactly: \\'I don\\'t have the specific details on that right now. I recommend checking our General Contact Page to speak with a specialist.\\' When sharing links, format them as markdown like [Link Text](URL).\", \"query\": \"User has asked to contact Arctic, so respond with a suitable message to deliver shafaitahir8@gmail.com this email to the user and tell them that they can contact on this email to set up a meeting.\", \"query_embedding\": [-0.04122545197606087, -0.0083044758066535, 0.03901446983218193, 0.046572551131248474, -0.05245884507894516, -0.030693547800183296, 0.045156653970479965, -0.025080684572458267, -0.022301379591226578, -0.012883205898106098, -0.08289412409067154, -0.09678550064563751, -0.037416063249111176, 0.039305929094552994, 0.0816061869263649, -0.007152551785111427, -0.0172746479511261, -0.06555309891700745, -0.013918417505919933, 0.00260770320892334, -0.005398570094257593, -0.044974882155656815, 0.033015333116054535, -0.006542380899190903, -0.041297588497400284, -0.05752341076731682, 0.01402139663696289, 0.04604179412126541, -0.055932968854904175, 0.0962958037853241, 0.046318165957927704, 0.08379955589771271, 0.041527558118104935, 0.09211115539073944, 0.03678687661886215, 0.08512789011001587, 0.0058051361702382565, 0.03298730403184891, -0.11790892481803894, -0.008208127692341805, -0.07651637494564056, -0.03081761859357357, -0.002898141276091337, -0.06651516258716583, -0.02904597