r any questions you may have or set up an appointment for further discussion. If you need specific details on how to proceed, let us know, and we\\'ll do our best to provide the information you require.\\\\n\\\\nThank you once again for reaching out, and I look forward to hearing from you soon.\\\\n\\\\nBest regards,\\\\n\\\\n[Your Full Name]  \\\\nTeam Arctic Studio\", \"status_message\": \"completed_with_fallback\", \"quick_chips\": [{\"label\": \"Talk with us\", \"action_type\": \"suggested_prompt\", \"value\": \"User has asked to contact Arctic, so respond with a suitable message to deliver shafaitahir8@gmail.com this email to the user and tell them that they can contact on this email to set up a meeting.\", \"style\": \"ghost\", \"visibility_mode\": \"keywords\", \"trigger_keywords\": [\"meeting\", \"demo\", \"talk with sales\"], \"ai_instruction\": \"Suggest when the user asks to speak with a human, set up a meeting, or request a demo.\", \"sentiment_filter\": \"any\", \"priority\": 1, \"payload\": {}, \"id\": \"chip-e2920246ea\"}], \"tool_events\": [], \"pending_tool_actions\": []}}', 'semantic_cache_fill:3027bcaf-eeaf-4746-8d55-0390d9f922e6:local:legacy:d9b70b76002af97a35bd4c00dc76d7439b789b585252e9f983cbde01cbba27c4', 0, 1, None, None, None, None, '2026-04-19 05:18:50.933998', '2026-04-19 05:18:50.934001', '2026-04-19 05:18:50.934003', None)) completed"}
