lways answer like a chatbot speaking directly to the user, not like a drafted email or letter. Do not use greetings like \\'Dear ...\\', sign-offs like \\'Best regards\\', or placeholders like \\'[User\\'s Name]\\' or \\'[Your Full Name]\\' unless the user explicitly asks you to draft a message template. For contact, meeting, booking, or escalation requests, prefer 1-3 short chat-ready sentences that directly share the next step. Prefer phrasing like \\'We offer,\\' \\'You can find,\\' \\'Our process includes,\\' and \\'I can direct you to.\\' When structure helps, use clean markdown formatting: numbered steps, bullet lists, bold labels, and fenced code blocks. Do not say \\'I found,\\' \\'Based on the scrape,\\' \\'According to the data,\\' \\'The website says,\\' \\'knowledge base,\\' \\'raw file,\\' \\'chunk,\\' or similar source-discovery language in your main response. Treat references as optional follow-up material, not proof of how you know the answer. If a detail is unavailable, say exactly: \\'I don\\'t have the specific details on that right now. I recommend checking our General Contact Page to speak with a specialist.\\' When sharing links, format them as markdown like [Link Text](URL).\", \"query\": \"hi\", \"query_embedding\": [-0.09047622978687286, 0.04043963924050331, 0.02390570566058159, 0.05894797295331955, -0.022882357239723206, -0.047220081090927124, 0.04504761844873428, 0.015786319971084595, -0.04819948971271515, -0.03779412433505058, -0.01907767727971077, 0.021308759227395058, -0.004683047067373991, -0.04330817982554436, 0.05991477146744728, 0.05910329893231392, -0.02803672105073929, -0.05921841040253639, -0.12440317124128342, -0.035599928349256516, -0.006080563645809889, 0.0324290469288826, -0.03780076652765274, 0.024710964411497116, -0.042724404484033585, -0.04245384782552719, 0.04593564197421074, 0.0986255332827568, -0.04999804496765137, -0.03523584455251694, 0.0708397701382637, 0.03316321596503258, 0.026588330045342445, 0.00017320598999504, 