d how I can assist you and direct you to the right resource within our team.\", \"status_message\": \"completed_with_fallback\", \"quick_chips\": [{\"label\": \"Talk with us\", \"action_type\": \"suggested_prompt\", \"value\": \"User has asked to contact Arctic, so respond with a suitable message to deliver shafaitahir8@gmail.com this email to the user and tell them that they can contact on this email to set up a meeting.\", \"style\": \"ghost\", \"visibility_mode\": \"keywords\", \"trigger_keywords\": [\"meeting\", \"demo\", \"talk with sales\"], \"ai_instruction\": \"Suggest when the user asks to speak with a human, set up a meeting, or request a demo.\", \"sentiment_filter\": \"any\", \"priority\": 1, \"payload\": {}, \"id\": \"chip-e2920246ea\"}], \"tool_events\": [], \"pending_tool_actions\": []}}', 'semantic_cache_fill:3027bcaf-eeaf-4746-8d55-0390d9f922e6:local:legacy:8efecba96ab9bbb3577b3291616785cb4af1e8bf266a3cd84770ef74cf6be590', 0, 1, None, None, None, None, '2026-04-19 06:35:50.639971', '2026-04-19 06:35:50.639977', '2026-04-19 06:35:50.639981', None))"}
