\\' \\'The website says,\\' \\'knowledge base,\\' \\'raw file,\\' \\'chunk,\\' or similar source-discovery language in your main response. Treat references as optional follow-up material, not proof of how you know the answer. If a detail is unavailable, say exactly: \\'I don\\'t have the specific details on that right now. I recommend checking our General Contact Page to speak with a specialist.\\' When sharing links, format them as markdown like [Link Text](URL).\", \"query\": \"Respond as a chatbot in 1-2 short sentences. Do not write an email, letter, greeting, sign-off, or placeholders. Give the user the direct answer only. Audit a HubSpot module\", \"query_embedding\": [-0.006416493561118841, 0.025474390015006065, 0.04376596584916115, 0.03258141875267029, 0.06724245101213455, -0.04071488603949547, 0.054507214576005936, 0.03572271019220352, -0.03902376443147659, -0.040284834802150726, 0.020026598125696182, -0.020764010027050972, 0.00945864338427782, -0.02246679551899433, 0.03324508294463158, 0.024198191240429878, 0.07450283318758011, -0.07509374618530273, 0.03943498060107231, -0.007800125516951084, -0.0033517044503241777, -2.6122850613319315e-05, -0.0034666331484913826, -0.008419683203101158, -0.012097506783902645, -0.08113966882228851, 0.037528570741415024, 0.08491590619087219, -0.06799471378326416, 0.027284352108836174, 0.03601858764886856, 0.018637022003531456, 0.03240309655666351, 0.06979959458112717, 0.02783687599003315, 0.020395997911691666, -0.00645742192864418, 0.03825000301003456, -0.02030034363269806, -0.08575478196144104, -0.073625348508358, -0.13136984407901764, 0.00602641049772501, 0.007426853757351637, 0.012022441253066063, -0.03882921114563942, -0.06641431152820587, 0.04649905487895012, 0.026712896302342415, 0.05139024555683136, -0.031601160764694214, -0.038279589265584946, 0.019144760444760323, 0.06124311313033104, -0.02351485565304756, 0.0369667112827301, -0.06137090176343918, 0.10792168974876404, 0.02601398341357708, -0.11540091037750244, 0.009